{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-02",
  "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "样本损失汇总为目标函数，训练寻找使该目标较小的参数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "一次更新沿目标函数对参数的负梯度方向移动，学习率控制步长。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SGD 在数据子集上计算梯度；批大小为 1 时逐样本更新，批大小为 N 时是标准梯度下降。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "动量使当前步倾向延续先前更新方向；动量强度是超参数，并非总能改善优化。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "局部极小值、梯度消失、零梯度和梯度爆炸会妨碍优化；裁剪把过大梯度限制到阈值范围。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "讲义用 ReLU 说明实践中的损失或节点不必处处光滑；ReLU 在零点以外可微。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "深度学习计算可表示为由可微函数节点构成的有向无环图。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 26
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "复合向量函数的 Jacobian 按依赖顺序相乘；矩阵形状提供重要的正确性检查。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "反向传播从损失端逆向传递共享导数项，避免为每个参数重复计算整条链。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "输出侧梯度与层对输入、参数的局部 Jacobian 相乘，得到输入侧梯度和参数梯度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "平均损失的梯度等于各数据点损失梯度的平均。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "在讲义的行向量梯度约定下，线性层把输出梯度乘以权重矩阵以传回输入。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 46
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "一个变量影响多条下游路径时，反向贡献求和；共享参数的各次使用同样需要累加梯度。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 55
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "反向传播也可计算标量代价对输入的梯度；单元可视化沿输入梯度上升并可加入正则项。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 66
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
